id: cb-07-two-gates
number: 507
name: Two Gates
description: A wall you can shoot over but not walk through. Three ways past it, four of you, and a shelf behind each segment worth standing on.
design: Combat Manoeuvre 7 — the curtain wall.
design: No pits, no spikes. Two wall segments leave a centre gate and a lane down each flank, with a shelf of high ground behind each segment.
design: There is no line of sight in this game: the wall stops feet, not arrows.

spawn h = Husk
spawn s = Stalker
spawn l = Lobber

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Archer, Wardbearer

